        <head>ASPIN ALL'S ENAMELS.</head>
        <p>ASPIN ALL'S ENAMELS.</p>
        <p>A shabby bath takes all the enjoyment out of the morning tub: it can be made to look epic and span with Aspinall's Bath Enamel which gives a coat like porcelain, resists the hottest water, and wears ten times as long as ordinary paint. Hot water cans after having become shabby in use can also be made to look as good as new when re-painted with Aspinall's Enamel. Those modern pretty candlesticks, too, can be treated in the same way to match their surround- ings, e.g., pale blue bedroom, pale blue candlesticks— quite simple and highly effective. •</p>
