        <head>NATIONAL RESERVE.</head>
        <p>THE NATIONAL RESERVE.</p>
        <p>The National Reserve, which consists of civilians who have served in any branch of his Majesty's forces, will parade on the date of the Royal visit at 1.30 p.m. and proceed to special positions allotted to them in the Town Hall grounds. All medals and decorations I will be worn.</p>
