        <p>73 118 Bewsey No. 1 won by 45. Latchford No 2. Whitecross No. 2. F Heesum ••• ••• 15 J Lester ... 7 J ilitchmough ... 15 J Rowlands ... 12 E Bailey ... ... 15 J Savage ... ... 9 G H Smith ... ... 15 W J Hill G W Shakeshaft ... 15 J A Mather ... 10 W Daniels ... 15 J Warburton... ... 8 P Harbourne 15 J Lawton ... ... 13 B Lee ... T Ellison, sen. ... 15</p>
        <p>167 81 Latchford No 2 won by 26. Whitecross No. 4. Orford No. 2. R Warburton ... ... 5 H Eyes... ... 15 W Lowe... ... ... 8 J Thompson ... 15 Or Stockton 15 Moreland 6 H Houghton ... ... 15 A Regan ... 13 F Pritchard ... ... 12 J Bate ... ... 15 J Slavin... ... ... 14 J W Plinston ... 15 H Warburton ... ... 15 J Jolley .. 5 H Weedall ... 7 H Higham ...15</p>
        <p>Orford No. 2 won by 8. Draw for 3rd round to be played to-day. 2-33 Whitecross No. 3 v Bewsey No. 2 3-15 Fairfield No. 1 v Latcbford No. 1 4-0 Whitecross No. 5 v Orford No. 2 4-45 Latchford No. 2 v Bewsey No. 1 There will be no matches on Saturday next, owing to Walking Day holidays.</p>
