        <p>Marriages. MILLETT—ELWELL.—On the 21st inst., at Legh- street Primitive• Methodist Church, by the Revs. J. B. Buglass and W. Cooper, John Lionel Willett, son of the late Mr. and Mrs. J. M. Millett, of Warrington, to Edith Walters Elwell, daughter ot Mr. and Mrs. T. Elwell, of Warrington. McCOLLOM—BOARDMAN.—On the 25th inst., at the Warrington Parish Church, by the Rev. J. M. Buckmaster, Herbert Hope McCollom to Clara Boardman. HINKS—WRIGHT.—On the 24th inst., at the War- rington Parish Church, by the Rev. Canon Willis, Henry Chttrles Edwin Hinks to Eleanor Royle Wright.</p>
